================================================================================
Kanna v3
================================================================================

Derived from Kanna v3:

  crates/kanna-detect
      A port of Kanna v3's crates/kanna3-detect (the rule engine, the rule
      store with its remote index, hashes, HTTPS fetch and cache, the
      version probe and the foreground-program check from crates/kanna3d's
      terminal.rs), with v4's statuses, regions and progress tests.
  agent-rules/*.json, agent-rules/corpus
      From kanna3-detect's manifests/*.json and corpus/ (Kanna v3, by way of
      Kanna v2's rules), with v4's status names.
  tools/agent-harness/mock_server.py
      From Kanna v3's tools/characterize/mock_server.py (the scripted
      Anthropic Messages, OpenAI Responses and Chat Completions server);
      record.py and run.py follow its record.py and run_all.py.

