Ghostty
https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty
MIT License
================================================================================

Derived from Ghostty:

  crates/kanna-keeper/src/ghostty_env.rs
      Adapted from Ghostty at the commit scripts/env.sh pins
      (KANNA_GHOSTTY_COMMIT): src/termio/Exec.zig (Subprocess.init and
      execCommand), src/termio/shell_integration.zig, src/os/locale.zig,
      src/os/resourcesdir.zig and src/apprt/embedded.zig (defaultTermioEnv).
      Ported from kanna-v3's kanna3-keeper, by way of the relay keeper.
  apps/kanna/Sources/Kanna/Terminal/TerminalSurfaceView.swift
      Adapted from Ghostty's macOS app (Ghostty 4ec3122, via kanna v3):
      SurfaceView_AppKit.swift, Ghostty.Input.swift and
      NSEvent+Extension.swift.
  apps/kanna/Sources/Kanna/Terminal/GhosttyRuntime.swift
      Runtime callbacks follow Ghostty's macOS app (Ghostty 4ec3122, via
      kanna v3): Ghostty.App.swift. Its handling of config reloads, colour
      schemes, clipboard confirmation, bells, notifications and links
      follows Ghostty.App.swift at the commit scripts/env.sh pins.
  apps/kanna/Sources/KannaLinks/UntrustedURL.swift
  apps/kanna/Tests/KannaLinksTests/UntrustedURLTests.swift
  apps/kanna/Sources/Kanna/Terminal/LinkAlert.swift
      From Ghostty's macOS app at the commit scripts/env.sh pins:
      macos/Sources/Helpers/UntrustedURL.swift, UntrustedURLAlert.swift and
      macos/Tests/Ghostty/UntrustedURLTests.swift, with comments removed
      and the rules made stricter; UntrustedURL(clicked:), the handler,
      package and path checks and most tests are Kanna's.

Kanna.app links GhosttyKit and the daemon links libghostty-vt, both built
from a fork of Ghostty: the kanna4 branch (Kanna v3's kanna3 branch, on upstream
a806905, plus Kanna v4's commits) at the commit scripts/env.sh pins.

